Hello!

I'm sorry for the late summary but only last week Digital solve it!

I've received one answer from this list but it didn't solved the problem.

So the solution was:

At the prompt of the console >>> do

>>> set bus_probe_algorithm new
>>> init

and next install the Firmware CD V3.8.

