A temporary fix for the firewall was to put in the 
named.boot file the following lines...

forwarders ip_address_of_external_dns_provider
slave

This fixed DNS name resolution.

Then an MX record was added for outside.domain.com on the
firewall such as...

outside.domain.com. IN MX outside.domain.com.

I don't have the exact syntax with me so I'm not sure
